  "question": {
    "text": "When one light ray is reflected from a plane mirror with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> angle of reflection, the angle of deviation of the ray after reflection is:"
  },
  "options": [
