  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0071_c67b1f8803bc.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 343px;\" /></p><p>The formula for angle of deviation is&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#948;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>Substituting the values,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#948;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p>"
  }
